Upstream project
----------------

Horizon iOS is an unofficial port of Horizon, a Rust reimplementation of Minecraft: Java Edition
26.3:

  https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon

The upstream project is also MIT-licensed. Its copyright notice and attribution are preserved in
LICENSE, in the Git history, and in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

